===>Step 0
===>Test Case: "Two years ago, my life was unrecognizable. I was deep in the throes of addiction, my days and nights blurring into a continuous cycle of seeking the next drink. My job was hanging by a thread, my relationships were strained, and my health was deteriorating. I hit rock bottom when I missed my daughter's birthday because I was too drunk to remember the date. That was a wake-up call. I knew I had to make a change.
I've been sober for six months now and can't imagine returning to my old life. My relationships have improved significantly, I feel healthier, and for the first time in a long while, I have savings in my bank account. The thought of abandoning my family again and losing these positive changes is unthinkable. This journey has shown me a better way to live, and I'm committed to maintaining it.”

